@0    = ~The tower's well. Due to the proximity of the sea, the water is rather brackish but good enough for non-potable uses and watering the fields.~
@1    = ~You use the well to fill the barrel with water.~
@2    = ~You put the barrel containing the fire elemental into the well.~
@3    = ~You try a sip of the well water.~
@4    = ~You throw a gold coin into the well, as is the tradition for making a wish.~
@5    = ~You throw another gold coin into the well, as is the tradition for making a wish.~
@6    = ~You let a pebble fall into the well.~
@7    = ~You let another pebble fall into the well.~
@8    = ~You let the tenth pebble fall into the well.~
@9    = ~You leave the well alone.~
@10   = ~The barrel floats on the surface, slowly sinking as water enters the interior.~
@11   = ~You take the barrel out again.~
@12   = ~You watch the barrel fill completely with water, drowning the fire elemental.~
@13   = ~The barrel is now full of water. The fire elemental is dead.~
@14   = ~The barrel is now full of water.~
@15   = ~The water tastes salty and a little moldy, but better than some you had out in the wild.~
@16   = ~The coin hitting the surface makes a distinct "splish" sound, then sinks out of sight into the water.~
@17   = ~[Imoen] Oh, I want to do that, too. What did you wish for, <CHARNAME>? Wait! Don't tell me, or it won't come true. There! And gone it is. I wish for a nice, comfortable house in a not-too-big city, with servants and a *cat* just for me... no, I mean I will *not* wish *this*, because you're not supposed to say it out loud!~
@18   = ~[Alora] Me too, me too! (Alora breathes in audibly, coin in hand.) Now, in you go. Make me happy!~
@19   = ~This coin also makes a distinct "splish" sound when hitting the water surface, then tumbles out of sight into the water.~
@20   = ~[Jaheira] I do *not* know what you are trying to accomplish with this, <CHARNAME>. Please tell me you do not believe in wish-granting wells.~
@21   = ~[Imoen] Give it time, give it time, <CHARNAME>! It won't go quicker if you wish for it several times. Although—this is really fun. *giggles* Aaaand—hop!~
@22   = ~*sigh*~
@23   = ~We'd best not scold <CHARNAME> for this game—<PRO_HESHE> has little enough pleasure in <PRO_HISHER> life as it is.~
@24   = ~[Imoen] You know that I have to restrict myself every time you do that so I won't do it, too, right? I'm sooo prooooud of myself for not throwing in the whole purse!~
@25   = ~[Minsc] Minsc doesn't understand why <CHARNAME> wants to use the well for cleaning all those gold coins... What, Boo? Ah! I see. <CHARNAME> is stashing them for later. Very smart!~
@26   = ~[Eldoth] Just in case anyone is considering throwing all our gold into that well, be assured I will expect you to get it out again.~
@27   = ~[Kagain] Anyone thinking about throwing all our gold into that well will die by my hand.~
@28   = ~[Ajantis, with Imoen] That would be a great waste indeed, Imoen. I never know when you are talking in jest and when...~
@29   = ~[Imoen, with Ajantis] ...when I am about to make something completely foolish? Ah, Ajantis!...~
@30   = ~[Imoen] No worries. I would *never* throw in my whole purse!...~
@31   = ~[Ajantis, with Imoen] That's a relief to hear.~
@32   = ~[Imoen] I would throw in someone else's, of course! *giggles*~
@33   = ~[Alora] Had I known you part so easily with your gold, <CHARNAME>, I wouldn't have spent so much time looking through pockets elsewhere. *giggles* Don't let me spoil your fun, though!~
@34   = ~[Montaron] Had I known you part so easily with gold coins, I wouldn't have joined forces with you, <CHARNAME>. Are we *done* here?!~
@35   = ~[Imoen] I know I just did it myself, but... Imagining all the coins at the bottom of the cold, dark water, for *millennia* before someone makes them shine again is rather depressing... Have to focus on the wishes! The wishes. I hope you wished for something great, <CHARNAME>!~
@36   = ~[Yeslick, PC male] I'm not sure what you are wishing for there, lad, but I'm pretty sure doing it multiple times will not increase the likelihood of it coming true.~
@37   = ~[Yeslick, PC female] I'm not sure what you are wishing for there, gal, but I'm pretty sure doing it multiple times will not increase the likelihood of it coming true.~
@38   = ~[Khalid] I d-don't know what you are wishing for, <CHARNAME>, but I surely hope it's worth the gold.~
@39   = ~[Kagain] There is *no* wish that justifies throwing away gold like this.~
@40   = ~[Shar-Teel] Foolish beliefs. The gold is better spent on equipment for our tasks.~
@41   = ~[Xan] I will not elaborate why the human tradition of throwing gold into wells is a completely foolish thing to do, and futile on top of it.~
@42   = ~[Eldoth] The next time you feel like throwing away gold, you just give it to me. I can make dreams come true, too—at least as "well" as this well.~
@43   = ~[Skie] If you feel like throwing away gold, you just put it right here into my purse, <CHARNAME>!~
@44   = ~[Garrick] This is so picturesque—<CHARNAME>, standing at the Seatower's well, wishing for <PRO_HISHER> heartfelt desires... Would you do that once more, please? I need to capture the spirit just right...~
@45   = ~[Safana] How can you waste gold for such childish play? There are far better ways to spend gold in a city.~
@46   = ~[Edwin] I guess you are the only one trying to taunt the "well spirit" with gold coins instead of pebbles, <CHARNAME>. (Foolish behavior. I guess I can be thankful <PRO_HESHE> only throws one gold coin at a time.)~
@47   = ~[Kivan] One day they'll find a drowned fool in that well who was attracted by all the gold coins at the bottom.~
@48   = ~After a relatively short time, you hear a "plunk" sound when the pebble hits the surface.~
@49   = ~You hear again a "plunk" sound when the pebble hits the surface.~
@50   = ~The expected "plunk" sound is swallowed by the angry hiss of a drowned spirit you disturbed!~
@51   = ~We like coming to the tower. The children like the animals and it is safe here.~
@52   = ~I will save some of my bread and feed the seagulls later!~
@53   = ~I want to go pet the cows later!~
